/E (Ashesi is all the way on the mountain. Secluded from the rest of the nation. Although it provides the perfect environment for concentrated vision attainment and focus, it also fosters feelings of detachment, loneliness and isolation. We cannot move Ashesi physically, but we can shift the culture. Under our leadership, and the leadership of every member of this community we can heal and innovate, recover and run. Oftentime, we feel as though every decision of our academic life is thrown at us, with limited consultation. But we promise student involvement and initiative. Our government will prioritise amplifying students' voices, and representing them in a way that goes unnoticed. Until your passions are explored, your physical health and mental health are taken care of and )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
